<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Opto-Hot · 其他</title><link>https://opto-hot-a455-d3g2s3dt865d86640.webapps.tcloudbase.com/#/all</link><description>其他</description><lastBuildDate>2026-08-09T06:13:14.780468+00:00</lastBuildDate><item><title>启明星辰上半年扭亏为盈 预计净利2600万至3800万元</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/123/a1313768.html</link><description>日前，启明星辰发布2026年半年度业绩预告。公司预计上半年实现营业收入12.1亿元至12.6亿元，同比增长6.84%至11.25%；归属于上市公司股东的净利润为2600万元至3800万元，上年同期为亏损9335万元，实现扭亏为盈；</description><guid isPermaLink="false">200fa3040fb9</guid><pubDate>2026-08-09T06:13:14.780468+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_通信财经</source><category>其他</category></item><item><title>华为提无线技术五大创新方向：筑牢Agentverse底座，将智能分发至世界每个角落</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/126/a1314291.html</link><description>纵观移动通信发展历程，驱动网络演进的，从来都是与业务、终端的同频共振。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">a6e05e78a8de</guid><pubDate>2026-08-09T06:13:14.780468+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_设备商</source><category>其他</category></item><item><title>“车灯一哥”星宇股份再闯港股，前常州女首富左手分红，右手拟募资</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-08/ART-250003-12003-30697269.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">4a2b3162ac34</guid><pubDate>2026-08-09T06:13:14.780468+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>其他</category></item><item><title>NASA能找到外星生命？英国押注300万英镑，却先要遮住恒星</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-08/ART-250003-8110-30697144.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">39c344b3ce74</guid><pubDate>2026-08-09T06:13:14.780468+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>其他</category></item><item><title>智驾“小蓝灯”将被禁用 夜间眩光刺眼还招加塞：官方出手</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-07/ART-250003-8110-30696444.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">ad6baf3c84f3</guid><pubDate>2026-08-09T06:13:14.780468+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>其他</category></item><item><title>15亿被套6年？欧菲光重组生死局</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-05/ART-8100-2500-30688151.ht